    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899250/extras/2639abad7015bb3f6282262efa5009de.poster.avif?t=1750154452\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899250/extras/2639abad7015bb3f6282262efa5009de.webm?t=1750154452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899250/extras/2639abad7015bb3f6282262efa5009de.mp4?t=1750154452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Jump up or give up. Nolgorb's Ordeal is a 3D platformer starring a cute kangaroo character escaping a dungeon.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899250/extras/64cc36bc75379a7821597d69a2587c62.poster.avif?t=1750154452\" width=636 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899250/extras/64cc36bc75379a7821597d69a2587c62.webm?t=1750154452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899250/extras/64cc36bc75379a7821597d69a2587c62.mp4?t=1750154452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Collect your precious figurines on the way, and trade them with the evil wizard for useful items.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899250/extras/2639abad7015bb3f6282262efa5009de.poster.avif?t=1750154452\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899250/extras/2639abad7015bb3f6282262efa5009de.webm?t=1750154452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899250/extras/2639abad7015bb3f6282262efa5009de.mp4?t=1750154452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Jump up or give up. Nolgorb's Ordeal is a 3D platformer starring a cute kangaroo character escaping a dungeon.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899250/extras/64cc36bc75379a7821597d69a2587c62.poster.avif?t=1750154452\" width=636 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899250/extras/64cc36bc75379a7821597d69a2587c62.webm?t=1750154452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899250/extras/64cc36bc75379a7821597d69a2587c62.mp4?t=1750154452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Collect your precious figurines on the way, and trade them with the evil wizard for useful items.",
